{
  "info": {
    "name": "L-ONE Arm (larm)",
    "description": "Controlo do braco CyberBrick L-ONE via o S3 (app 'larm'). O S3 retransmite por ESP-NOW para o recetor C3 no braco. Define `base_url` = IP do S3 (ex.: http://192.168.1.79).\n\nCONCEITO IMPORTANTE: a base (motor DC) e as juntas (servos continuos) NAO tem sensor de posicao -> os comandos sao VELOCIDADE, nao distancia/angulo. 'pct=50' = rodar a 50% ate parar. Para um movimento FIXO usa '&ms=400' (roda 400ms e para sozinho; distancia ~ velocidade x tempo). A claw (idx3) e o unico posicional (angulo real, sem ms).\n\nO caminho em tempo real e WebSocket (ws://<ip>:81). Estes HTTP sao p/ automacao (base da fase AI).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://192.168.1.79", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "config (GET)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET", "header": [],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/config", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app", "larm", "config"] },
        "description": "servos/motor/canal/WS/contadores."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "HOME / parar tudo (GET)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET", "header": [],
        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/home", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app", "larm", "home"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ombro (continua, idx1)  [velocidade x tempo]",
      "description": "Servo continuo: angulo=velocidade (92~parado). Com &ms faz um nudge fixo e para.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ombro  <-  nudge (angle 60, 400ms)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/move?idx=1&angle=60&ms=400", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","move"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"1"}, {"key":"angle","value":"60"}, {"key":"ms","value":"400","description":"roda 400ms e para. Aumenta p/ mover mais."} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ombro  ->  nudge (angle 120, 400ms)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/move?idx=1&angle=120&ms=400", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","move"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"1"}, {"key":"angle","value":"120"}, {"key":"ms","value":"400"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ombro  STOP",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/stop?idx=1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","stop"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"1"} ] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cotovelo (continua, idx2)  [velocidade x tempo]",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cotovelo  <-  nudge (angle 60, 400ms)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/move?idx=2&angle=60&ms=400", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","move"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"2"}, {"key":"angle","value":"60"}, {"key":"ms","value":"400"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cotovelo  ->  nudge (angle 120, 400ms)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/move?idx=2&angle=120&ms=400", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","move"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"2"}, {"key":"angle","value":"120"}, {"key":"ms","value":"400"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cotovelo  STOP",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/stop?idx=2", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","stop"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"2"} ] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Garra (posicional, idx3)  [angulo real]",
      "description": "Unico posicional: vai ao angulo e fica. 150=abrir, 30=fechar (sem ms).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Garra  ABRIR (angle 150)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/move?idx=3&angle=150", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","move"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"3"}, {"key":"angle","value":"150"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Garra  FECHAR (angle 30)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/move?idx=3&angle=30", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","move"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"3"}, {"key":"angle","value":"30"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Garra  MEIO (angle 90)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/move?idx=3&angle=90", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","move"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"3"}, {"key":"angle","value":"90"} ] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Base (motor DC, idx1)  [velocidade x tempo]",
      "description": "Motor DC (yaw). pct -100..100 = velocidade. Com &ms faz um nudge fixo e para. Sem ms, roda ate STOP (ou ate o deadman ~1.5s).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Base  <-  nudge (pct -50, 400ms)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/motor?idx=1&pct=-50&ms=400", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","motor"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"1"}, {"key":"pct","value":"-50"}, {"key":"ms","value":"400","description":"roda 400ms e para"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Base  ->  nudge (pct 50, 400ms)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/motor?idx=1&pct=50&ms=400", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","motor"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"1"}, {"key":"pct","value":"50"}, {"key":"ms","value":"400"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Base  STOP (pct 0)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/motor?idx=1&pct=0", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","motor"],
              "query": [ {"key":"idx","value":"1"}, {"key":"pct","value":"0"} ] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Animacoes (POST /seq)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Acenar (base + claw)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ {"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"} ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\"a\":\"m\",\"i\":1,\"v\":50,\"d\":300},\n    {\"a\":\"m\",\"i\":1,\"v\":-50,\"d\":300},\n    {\"a\":\"m\",\"i\":1,\"v\":50,\"d\":300},\n    {\"a\":\"m\",\"i\":1,\"v\":-50,\"d\":300},\n    {\"a\":\"p\",\"i\":3,\"v\":150,\"d\":350},\n    {\"a\":\"p\",\"i\":3,\"v\":30,\"d\":350},\n    {\"a\":\"p\",\"i\":3,\"v\":150,\"d\":350},\n    {\"a\":\"m\",\"i\":1,\"v\":0,\"d\":50}\n  ]\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/seq", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","seq"] },
            "description": "Passos: a='p' servo angulo | a='c' continuo roda d ms | a='m' motor d ms | a='w' esperar | a='h' home."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "parar sequencia",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/seqstop", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","seqstop"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dead reckoning / Poses",
      "description": "O S3 integra a velocidade comandada -> posicao ESTIMADA por eixo (unidades 'u'; s1/s2=juntas, m1=base, p3=garra em graus reais). Setup: levar o braco a mao a uma referencia e fazer /zero. Poses = snapshot da estimativa; /posego converge em loop fechado sobre a estimativa. A estimativa DERIVA -> re-zerar; reboot do S3 perde-a.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "estado (estimativa + poses)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/state", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","state"] },
            "description": "{est:{s1,s2,m1,p3}, goto:bool, poses:[nomes]}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "ZERO aqui (calibracao humana)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/zero", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","zero"] },
            "description": "Poe a estimativa de todos os eixos a 0 na posicao FISICA atual." }
        },
        {
          "name": "HOME = posicao atual",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/homeset", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","homeset"] },
            "description": "Define a pose HOME (configuravel, persistida). O botao/endpoint /home passa a ir para ela." }
        },
        {
          "name": "ESTOU no home (sync)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/homesync", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","homesync"] },
            "description": "O braco foi posto FISICAMENTE na pose home (apos reboot/deriva): a estimativa adota as coordenadas do home -> conserta todas as poses de uma vez." }
        },
        {
          "name": "editar HOME (POST)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ {"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"} ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"vals\": {\"s1\": 0, \"s2\": 0, \"m1\": 0, \"p3\": 30}\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/homesave", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","homesave"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "ler pose (valores)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/poseget?name=pegar", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","poseget"],
              "query": [ {"key":"name","value":"pegar"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "editar pose (POST vals)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ {"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"} ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"pegar\",\n  \"vals\": {\"s1\": 10.5, \"s2\": -3, \"m1\": 25, \"p3\": 90}\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/posesave", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","posesave"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "ler animacao (passos)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/animget?name=rotina1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","animget"],
              "query": [ {"key":"name","value":"rotina1"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "aprender ganho direcional (base)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/callearn?axis=m1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","callearn"],
              "query": [ {"key":"axis","value":"m1"} ] },
            "description": "Apos ida-e-volta com regresso FISICO ao inicio: aprende a assimetria do motor (ganho do sentido negativo) e re-zera o eixo. O motor DC nao anda o mesmo p/ cada lado -- isto corrige a odometria." }
        },
        {
          "name": "guardar pose atual",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/posesave?name=pegar", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","posesave"],
              "query": [ {"key":"name","value":"pegar","description":"a-z 0-9 _ - (max 12)"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "ir para pose",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/posego?name=pegar", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","posego"],
              "query": [ {"key":"name","value":"pegar"} ] },
            "description": "Loop fechado sobre a estimativa; cancela com qualquer comando manual / stopall. Teto 25s." }
        },
        {
          "name": "apagar pose",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/posedel?name=pegar", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","posedel"],
              "query": [ {"key":"name","value":"pegar"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "guardar animacao (POST)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ {"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"} ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"rotina1\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\"p\": \"ground\", \"d\": 400},\n    {\"p\": \"top\", \"d\": 800}\n  ]\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/animsave", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","animsave"] },
            "description": "Encadeia POSES guardadas: vai a cada pose (goto/dead reckoning) e pausa d ms. Max 12 anims x 20 passos." }
        },
        {
          "name": "correr animacao",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/animgo?name=rotina1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","animgo"],
              "query": [ {"key":"name","value":"rotina1"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "apagar animacao",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/animdel?name=rotina1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","animdel"],
              "query": [ {"key":"name","value":"rotina1"} ] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "goto direto (POST, fase AI)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ {"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"} ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"s1\": 0,\n  \"s2\": -10.5,\n  \"m1\": 20,\n  \"p3\": 110\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/app/larm/goto", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["app","larm","goto"] },
            "description": "Alvo em coordenadas estimadas (u), sem precisar de pose guardada. Chaves opcionais." }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
